: "SaveImage", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "SaveImage"}, "order": 17}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "IMAGE", "links": [746, 771], "label": "IMAGE", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "IMAGE"}, {"name": "MASK", "label": "MASK", "type": "MASK", "localized_name": "MASK"}], "size": [307.5795593261719, 337.3320617675781], "pos": [63.42593765258789, 2437.896728515625], "widgets_values": ["8db6a394cecdc1d95f29686b1d8bed74c9e1cfa38a7b04d63a23a9b42193bba3.png", "image"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "image"}, "name": "image", "label": "image", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "image"}, {"widget": {"name": "upload"}, "name": "upload", "label": "upload", "type": "IMAGEUPLOAD", "localized_name": "choose file to upload"}], "flags": {}, "id": 470, "type": "LoadImage", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {"image": true, "upload": true}, "Node name for S&R": "LoadImage"}, "order": 3}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"shape": 6, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "size": [435.04052734375, 276.02471923828125], "pos": [1844.1097412109375, 2965.29443359375], "widgets_values": ["Generate a single 3x3 nine-panel grid head-closeup expression card whose outer canvas background is pure white and whose nine evenly sized cells are separated by clean thin gutters of uniform width. Every cell features the same young woman from <image1>, locking her identity exactly as in the reference — identical face shape, facial features, warm skin tone, long chestnut-brown hair with wispy air bangs framing the forehead, soft natural makeup, and the visible portion of her cream blazer over a white collared shirt kept consistent where the crop includes shoulders — so she reads as one and the same person across all nine close-ups, each panel cropped tightly from the top of her hair down to just below her chin. Inside every cell the portrait sits against a festive celebratory gradient backdrop blending deep China red at the corners into bright white toward the center, and each panel carries one small National Day element sticker placed on the face or hair area, with nine different stickers assigned in order: 1. top-left cell, sweet closed-mouth smile, a small red five-pointed star sticker on her left cheek; 2. top-middle cell, bright open laugh showing teeth, a miniature red-and-gold flag sticker at the upper right of her hair; 3. top-right cell, playful wink with one eye closed and a grin, a cluster of two small red stars over her forehead bangs area; 4. middle-left cell, pursed-lips pouty cute face, a golden ribbon bow sticker at the corner of her hair; 5. center cell, wide-eyed surprised expression with raised brows, a single small gold star sticker beside her right eye; 6. middle-right cell, shy blush with heart-shaped eyes, a small red-and-gold ribbon sticker on her left cheek; 7. bottom-left cell, cool confident closed-lip smirk, a miniature golden flag sticker at the upper left of her hair; 8. bottom-middle cell, playful tongue-out expression, a single small red star sticker on her right cheek; 9. bottom-right cell, content sleepy cat-mouth smile, a tiny golden bow sticker beside her hair edge. All nine cells keep uniform sizing and alignment with consistent gutters, the gradient style stays identical from panel to panel, every face keeps anatomically correct undistorted features with symmetrical eyes and natural facial structure, and the card stays completely free of added text, labels, watermarks, and captions."], "inputs": [{"name": "text", "link": 773, "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "id": 499, "type": "JjkShowText", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "JjkShowText"}, "order": 11}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "image_urls", "label": "image_urls", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "image_urls"}, {"name": "images", "label": "images", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "images"}], "size": [972.55108642